*Ditulis berdasarkan: Coelho, M., Rianço-Silva, R., Gonçalves, D., Machado, P., & Martins, Z. (2026). Detection of hydrocarbons in Titan using high-resolution cross-correlation spectroscopy. RASTI, arXiv:2609.03975v1*
